# Almost intentionally empty: pub consults .gitignore only when no
# .pubignore exists, and this package's build output (blobs/, the wasm-pkg,
# the frb glue) is gitignored but MUST ship. The one exception below is the
# reason this file is no longer completely empty.

# The unpacked macOS xcframework must NOT enter the archive. `dart pub
# publish` dereferences symlinks, and a macOS framework without its
# symlinks is not merely untidy — it fails `codesign` outright, so a
# consumer's `flutter build macos` dies with "Command CodeSign failed".
# Measured, not inferred; see `just cbor-vendor-macos`'s header comment.
#
# `macos/Frameworks/CratestackCborNative.xcframework.zip` ships INSTEAD
# (zips store symlinks) and `macos/cratestack_cbor.podspec`'s
# `prepare_command` unpacks it at pod-install time. Shipping both would
# defeat the point, so the directory is excluded here and the zip is not.
macos/Frameworks/*.xcframework/
